  "summary": "I am a full-stack software engineer with over ten years of experience. Our agile team works closely with other departments to create tools that simplify tasks and improve efficiency. A recent inventory counting tool reduced setup times from over an hour to around 5 minutes. I love creating new systems where needed, but I'm also skilled in troubleshooting and enhancing existing programs. I enjoy mentoring other developers and learning from them as well. Over my career, I have written systems for manufacturing, distribution, our call center, marketing, and Crutchfield's e-commerce website. I continue to take classes to keep up with the latest trends and share this information with my peers.\n\nCompetencies: Kanban, Teamwork, Vue.js with Composition API, TypeScript/JavaScript, HTML, CSS/SASS, REST APIs, C#, ASP.NET, SQL/TSQL, TFS, Blazor\n\nI enjoy learning new things and connecting with people across various industries, so don't hesitate to reach out if you'd like to get in touch.\n\nEmail: bergenb.software@gmail.com",
